# Utility Scripts

This directory contains utility scripts for the Pawel Lipowczan Portfolio project.

## Available Scripts

### Build & SEO

- **`prerender.mjs`** - Generates static HTML for all pages using Puppeteer for SEO
- **`build-with-prerender.mjs`** - Build orchestrator that runs Vite build + prerendering

### Content Management

- **`update-sitemap.js`** - Automatically generates `sitemap.xml` from blog posts and static pages
- **`convert-to-webp.js`** - Converts PNG images to WebP format with optimization

### Image Processing (OG Images)

- **`resize-og-image.mjs`** - Resizes a single Open Graph image to 1200x630px
- **`resize-og-images-preview.mjs`** - Preview mode for resizing OG images
- **`apply-og-resize.mjs`** - Batch resize all OG images
- **`check-og-images.mjs`** - Validates OG images (size, format, naming)

## Documentation

See `scripts/README.md` for detailed usage instructions and examples.

## Usage

Most scripts can be run via npm commands:

```bash
npm run build:prerender  # Full build with prerendering
npm run blog:sitemap     # Update sitemap.xml
npm run img:convert      # Convert images to WebP
```

For direct execution:

```bash
node scripts/<script-name>
```
